    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Take a look inside our exclusive recovery campus, designed to offer a peaceful and supportive environment for your healing journey. Our boutique estate features two distinct residences, each providing a unique setting for privacy, comfort, and specialized care. We invite you to explore these spaces and see how our high-end amenities and 32-bed campus create a sanctuary where you can focus entirely on your stabilization and wellness.",
