    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 6,
      "text": "What Makes Us Different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "We Treat the Individual, Not the Disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Individualized Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "At Dallas Detox Center we treat each client as a unique individual and customized treatment plans according to each client's needs.",
      "text": "At Dallas Detox Center we treat each client as a unique individual and customized treatment plans according to each client's needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Devices Allowed"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "We understand that life doesn't stop just because you are ready to get help. Clients are allowed access to their devices per clinical recommedations.",
      "text": "We understand that life doesn't stop just because you are ready to get help. Clients are allowed access to their devices per clinical recommedations."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Dual-Diagnosis Focus"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "We understand that many clients also need treatment for co-occurring mental health issues, which is why we focus on dual-diagnosis at our rehab.",
      "text": "We understand that many clients also need treatment for co-occurring mental health issues, which is why we focus on dual-diagnosis at our rehab."
    },
